From: Kara Zajac <kara@soulstone.org>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 11:41:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] maki: shot's control port dumps the swapper's page table (rpt
 NAME)

`rpt NAME` writes who holds each of RAM's 512 pages, and when it was last used, into
OUT/rpt-NAME.txt, at a moment a test chooses (--rpt takes counts fixed at the start): before and
after an app opens, say. It reads the table where --rpt says, or where maki's loader puts it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KrrQLcb6MfwT6Kc7SresSY
---
 src/bin/shot.rs | 45 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 1 file changed, 34 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

